'''Victario's Flight''' is a pair of [[unique]] {{il|Goathide Boots}}.

==Modifiers==

* {{c|mod|[[Quicksilver Flask]]s also apply to nearby Allies}} functions similar to {{il|Umbilicus Immortalis}}. When you use a quicksilver flask, that flask's effect is applied to nearby allies for the flasks' duration (as well as to you, since this item doesn't prevent flasks applying to you).<ref>https://www.reddit.com/r/pathofexile/comments/wjl9xl/comment/ijiisqt/</ref> This includes Magic flask prefixes and suffixes. {{il|Rotgut}} will remove [[Frenzy Charges]] from Minions and grant them Onslaught. 
** A player wearing {{il|Mother's Embrace}} and spawning an Animate Guardian wearing Victario's Flight may be able to trigger a Quicksilver Flask on itself, which would then be shared to allies (including the player) {{speculation}}.

