==Legacy variants==
Victario's Flight has [[legacy variant]]s.

{{legacy variant table header}}
{{legacy variant table row|3.19.0|
* +15 to Dexterity
* +15 to Intelligence
* (100-150)% increased Evasion Rating
* {{c|mod|15% increased Movement Speed}}
* {{c|mod|(5-10)% of Damage taken Recouped as Mana}}
* {{c|mod|10% increased Movement Speed for you and nearby Allies}}
}}
{{legacy variant table row|2.6.0|
* +15 to Dexterity
* +15 to Intelligence
* (100-150)% increased Evasion Rating
* {{c|mod|30% increased Movement Speed when on Low Life}}
* {{c|mod|(5-10)% of Damage taken Recouped as Mana}}
}}
{{Legacy variant table end}}

The pre-2.6.0 version's {{c|mod|30% increased Movement Speed when on Low Life}} is not the same mod as the current variant,<ref>{{ml|MovementVelocityOnLowLifeUniqueBootsDex3}} verse {{ml|MovementVelocityOnLowLifeUnique__1}}</ref> so that legacy item can be divined without affected this mod. However, Divine Orb cannot gain any of the new mod on the legacy item.

